Subject: [PATCH] Redesign: Monoliths theme with Writing, Reading, Speaking and
 Contact

- New homepage with four sections, /writing/ archive and post layout
- Light and dark themes with Auto/Light/Dark switch, set before first paint
- Self-hosted fonts (Space Grotesk, Inter, JetBrains Mono, SIL OFL)
- Plain CSS and a small progressive-enhancement script
- /books/ and /about/ now point to homepage sections
- Fix the AutoGen D&D post (stray fence, missing player2 and imports, typos)
- Daily rebuild and safer Sessionize refresh
- Remove includes and styles from the old theme

